# **Kids Holiday workshops DRUM SING DANCE**

Kids Holiday workshops on June 27th 2013. This will be a day for the lil' ones. Rhythm Culture's Nathaniel Combs will be providing a school kids holiday workshops on the Sunshine Coast. This workshop will be a one off event and will have your little ones making music, getting physical and accessing their individual creativity. Creating musical sounds with the ancient West African drum, the Djembe will be the focus for this workshop and children of all ages will be drumming, singing and dancing. Be sure not to miss this special holiday event. Reserve your place early! @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall, Thursday June 27th, 10-11am $10 per child.

